  "description": "Disgruntled, jaded and broke, Jeremiah is tired of the mundane life. His twenties are as dull as he can imagine, until a golden, excitable, four-legged friend decides to join him on his walk home. What Jeremiah doesn’t know is that his new furry companion would bring more than a few surprises, and among them being an unlikely friendship that will propel him into a whirlwind of emotions he did NOT sign up for. He can’t tell if it’s a good thing... only one way to find out.",
